{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/actions/github-script/releases/307308602","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/actions/github-script/releases/307308602/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/actions/github-script/releases/307308602/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/actions/github-script/releases/tag/v9.0.0","id":307308602,"author":{"login":"salmanmkc","id":32169182,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMTY5MTgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32169182?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/salmanmkc","html_url":"https://github.com/salmanmkc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salmanmkc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salmanmkc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salmanmkc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salmanmkc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salmanmkc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salmanmkc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salmanmkc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salmanmkc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salmanmkc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":true},"node_id":"RE_kwDODDwPqM4SUSg6","tag_name":"v9.0.0","target_commitish":"main","name":"v9.0.0","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2026-04-09T22:44:58Z","updated_at":"2026-04-09T22:57:15Z","published_at":"2026-04-09T22:57:15Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/actions/github-script/tarball/v9.0.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/actions/github-script/zipball/v9.0.0","body":"**New features:**\r\n\r\n- **`getOctokit` factory function** — Available directly in the script context. Create additional authenticated Octokit clients with different tokens for multi-token workflows, GitHub App tokens, and cross-org access. See [Creating additional clients with `getOctokit`](https://github.com/actions/github-script#creating-additional-clients-with-getoctokit) for details and examples.\r\n- **Orchestration ID in user-agent** — The `ACTIONS_ORCHESTRATION_ID` environment variable is automatically appended to the user-agent string for request tracing.\r\n\r\n**Breaking changes:**\r\n\r\n- **`require('@actions/github')` no longer works in scripts.** The upgrade to `@actions/github` v9 (ESM-only) means `require('@actions/github')` will fail at runtime. If you previously used patterns like `const { getOctokit } = require('@actions/github')` to create secondary clients, use the new injected `getOctokit` function instead — it's available directly in the script context with no imports needed.\r\n- `getOctokit` is now an injected function parameter. Scripts that declare `const getOctokit = ...` or `let getOctokit = ...` will get a `SyntaxError` because JavaScript does not allow `const`/`let` redeclaration of function parameters. Use the injected `getOctokit` directly, or use `var getOctokit = ...` if you need to redeclare it.\r\n- If your script accesses other `@actions/github` internals beyond the standard `github`/`octokit` client, you may need to update those references for v9 compatibility.\r\n\r\n## What's Changed\r\n* Add ACTIONS_ORCHESTRATION_ID to user-agent string by @Copilot in https://github.com/actions/github-script/pull/695\r\n* ci: use deployment: false for integration test environments by @salmanmkc in https://github.com/actions/github-script/pull/712\r\n* feat!: add getOctokit to script context, upgrade @actions/github v9, @octokit/core v7, and related packages by @salmanmkc in https://github.com/actions/github-script/pull/700\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @Copilot made their first contribution in https://github.com/actions/github-script/pull/695\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/actions/github-script/compare/v8.0.0...v9.0.0\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/actions/github-script/releases/307308602/reactions","total_count":6,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":2,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"mentions_count":1}